 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Stave One. Marley’s Ghost",
   "x0": 33.166666666666664,
   "y0": 39.0,
   "x1": 98.83333333333334,
   "y1": 43.95,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": true,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Marley was dead: to begin with. There is no doubt whatever",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 49.4775,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 52.89416666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "about that. The register of his burial was signed by the cler-",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 54.239999999999995,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 57.65666666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "gyman, the clerk, the undertaker, and the chief mourner. Scrooge",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 59.0025,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 62.41916666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "signed it: and Scrooge’s name was good upon ‘Change, for",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 63.765,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 67.18166666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "anything he chose to put his hand to. Old Marley was as dead as",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 68.5275,
   "x1": 119.00000000000004,
   "y1": 71.94416666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a door-nail.",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 73.29,
   "x1": 31.833333333333332,
   "y1": 76.70666666666668,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mind! I don’t mean to say that I know, of my own knowledge,",
   "x0": 18.5,
   "y0": 78.05250000000001,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 81.46916666666668,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "what there is particularly dead about a door-nail. I might have",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 82.81500000000001,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 86.23166666666668,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "been inclined, myself, to regard a coffin-nail as the deadest piece",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 87.57750000000001,
   "x1": 118.99999999999999,
   "y1": 90.99416666666669,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of ironmongery in the trade. But the wisdom of our ancestors is",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 92.34000000000002,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 95.75666666666669,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "in the simile; and my unhallowed hands shall not disturb it, or",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 97.10250000000002,
   "x1": 118.99999999999996,
   "y1": 100.51916666666669,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the Country’s done for. You will therefore permit me to repeat,",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 101.86500000000002,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 105.2816666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "emphatically, that Marley was as dead as a door-nail.",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 106.62750000000003,
   "x1": 98.75,
   "y1": 110.0441666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Scrooge knew he was dead? Of course he did. How could it be",
   "x0": 18.5,
   "y0": 111.39000000000003,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 114.8066666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "otherwise? Scrooge and he were partners for I don’t know how",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 116.15250000000003,
   "x1": 118.99999999999999,
   "y1": 119.5691666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "many years. Scrooge was his sole executor, his sole",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 120.91500000000003,
   "x1": 113.5,
   "y1": 124.3316666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "administrator, his sole assign, his sole residuary legatee, his sole",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 125.67750000000004,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 129.0941666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "friend, and sole mourner. And even Scrooge was not so dread-",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 130.44000000000003,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 133.85666666666668,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "fully cut up by the sad event, but that he was an excellent man of",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 135.20250000000001,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 138.61916666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "business on the very day of the funeral, and solemnised it with an",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 139.965,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 143.38166666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "undoubted bargain.",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 144.7275,
   "x1": 44.833333333333336,
   "y1": 148.14416666666665,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mention of Marley’s funeral brings me back to the point I",
   "x0": 18.5,
   "y0": 149.48999999999998,
   "x1": 118.99999999999999,
   "y1": 152.90666666666664,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "started from. There is no doubt that Marley was dead. This must",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 154.25249999999997,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 157.66916666666663,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "be distinctly understood, or nothing wonderful can come of the",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 159.01499999999996,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 162.43166666666662,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "story I am going to relate. If we were not perfectly convinced that",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 163.77749999999995,
   "x1": 119.0,
   "y1": 167.1941666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hamlet’s Father died before the play began, there would be",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 168.53999999999994,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 171.9566666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "nothing more remarkable in his taking a stroll at night, in an eas-",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 173.30249999999992,
   "x1": 118.99999999999999,
   "y1": 176.71916666666658,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "terly wind, upon his own ramparts, than there would be in any",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 178.0649999999999,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 181.48166666666657,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "other middle-aged gentleman rashly turning out after dark in a",
   "x0": 13.0,
   "y0": 182.8274999999999,
   "x1": 119.00000000000001,
   "y1": 186.24416666666656,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "breezy spot—say Saint Paul’s Churchyard for instance—literally",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 17.0,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 20.416666666666668,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to astonish his son’s weak mind.",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 21.7625,
   "x1": 203.33333333333334,
   "y1": 25.179166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Scrooge never painted out Old Marley’s name. There it stood,",
   "x0": 156.5,
   "y0": 26.525,
   "x1": 256.99999999999983,
   "y1": 29.941666666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "years afterwards, above the warehouse door: Scrooge and",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 31.287499999999998,
   "x1": 257.00000000000006,
   "y1": 34.704166666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Marley. The firm was known as Scrooge and Marley. Sometimes",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 36.05,
   "x1": 257.00000000000017,
   "y1": 39.46666666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "people new to the business called Scrooge Scrooge, and",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 40.8125,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 44.229166666666664,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "sometimes Marley, but he answered to both names. It was all the",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 45.575,
   "x1": 256.99999999999983,
   "y1": 48.99166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "same to him.",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 50.337500000000006,
   "x1": 172.0,
   "y1": 53.75416666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh! But he was a tight-fisted hand at the grindstone, Scrooge!",
   "x0": 156.5,
   "y0": 55.10000000000001,
   "x1": 257.00000000000006,
   "y1": 58.51666666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a squeezing, wrenching, grasping, scraping, clutching, covetous,",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 59.86250000000001,
   "x1": 256.99999999999994,
   "y1": 63.279166666666676,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "old sinner! Hard and sharp as flint, from which no steel had ever",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 64.62500000000001,
   "x1": 257.0000000000001,
   "y1": 68.04166666666669,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "struck out generous fire; secret, and self-contained, and solitary",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 69.38750000000002,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 72.80416666666669,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "as an oyster. The cold within him froze his old features, nipped",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 74.15000000000002,
   "x1": 257.0000000000001,
   "y1": 77.56666666666669,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "his pointed nose, shrivelled his cheek, stiffened his gait; made his",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 78.91250000000002,
   "x1": 257.0000000000001,
   "y1": 82.3291666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "eyes red, his thin lips blue; and spoke out shrewdly in his grating",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 83.67500000000003,
   "x1": 256.9999999999999,
   "y1": 87.0916666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "voice. A frosty rime was on his head, and on his eyebrows, and",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 88.43750000000003,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 91.8541666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "his wiry chin. He carried his own low temperature always about",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 93.20000000000003,
   "x1": 257.0000000000001,
   "y1": 96.6166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with him; he iced his office in the dog-days; and didn’t thaw it",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 97.96250000000003,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 101.3791666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "one degree at Christmas.",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 102.72500000000004,
   "x1": 191.0,
   "y1": 106.14166666666671,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "External heat and cold had little influence on Scrooge. No",
   "x0": 156.5,
   "y0": 107.48750000000004,
   "x1": 257.00000000000006,
   "y1": 110.90416666666671,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "warmth could warm, no wintry weather chill him. No wind that",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 112.25000000000004,
   "x1": 256.99999999999983,
   "y1": 115.66666666666671,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "blew was bitterer than he, no falling snow was more intent upon",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 117.01250000000005,
   "x1": 256.99999999999994,
   "y1": 120.42916666666672,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "its purpose, no pelting rain less open to entreaty. Foul weather",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 121.77500000000005,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 125.19166666666672,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "didn’t know where to have him. The heaviest rain, and snow, and",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 126.53750000000005,
   "x1": 257.00000000000006,
   "y1": 129.9541666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "hail, and sleet, could boast of the advantage over him in only one",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 131.30000000000004,
   "x1": 257.0000000000001,
   "y1": 134.7166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "respect. They often “came down” handsomely, and Scrooge never",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 136.06250000000003,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 139.47916666666669,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "did.",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 140.82500000000002,
   "x1": 157.25,
   "y1": 144.24166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody ever stopped him in the street to say, with gladsome",
   "x0": 156.5,
   "y0": 145.5875,
   "x1": 257.00000000000017,
   "y1": 149.00416666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "looks, “My dear Scrooge, how are you? When will you come to",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 150.35,
   "x1": 257.0,
   "y1": 153.76666666666665,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "see me?” No beggars implored him to bestow a trifle, no children",
   "x0": 151.0,
   "y0": 155.11249999999998,
   "x1": 256.9999999999999,
   "y1": 158.52916666666664,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "asked him what it was o’clock, no man or woman ever once in all",
   "x0": 151.0,
